Nested `if` conditions can be merged together into a single condition. This can help improve code readability in complex codebases and reduce indentation level.

<!--more-->
### Bad Practice
```csharp
if (condition1)
{
    if (condition2)
    {
        if (condition3)
        {
            // ...
        }
    }
}
```

### Recommended
```csharp
if (condition1 && condition2 && condition3)
{
    // ...
}
```

